# Supabase — enables real accounts + cloud sync across devices.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the two values from your Supabase
# project: Settings → API. Leave them blank/unset and the app runs fully local
# (no login screen), exactly as it did before.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC by design (it ships in the browser bundle). Your data is
# protected by Row Level Security, not by hiding this key. Never put the
# `service_role` key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
